{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>For a person shall not see Me and live.</b> Rabbi Shimon the Yemenite said: 'a person' — as its plain meaning; 'and live' — these are the holy living creatures and the ministering angels. And what Isaiah said, 'and I saw YHWH' — that was through a speculum that does not illuminate. Speculum of a wall."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:42.533293589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}